/ [M2BDependencyUnknown] -(Delineation)> [DirectDependencyIdentity], [GeneratedFeatureAvailability], [GeneratedABIShape], [RuntimeCallAuthority]

& [BoundaryFormation] is decisive
  + [DirectDependencyIdentity] belongs inside this slice
  + [GeneratedFeatureAvailability] belongs inside this slice
  + [GeneratedABIShape] belongs inside this slice
  + [RuntimeCallAuthority] is explicitly outside this slice
  + [PhysicalObservation] is explicitly outside this slice
  - never: let successful linking imply permission to invoke an imported function

& [Purpose] is dependency readiness not scanner behavior
  + [problem] Cantor currently relies on another dependency's windows-sys feature union
  + [risk] a future dependency change can silently remove generated types required by the planned seam
  + [solution] declare the exact target dependency and compile the closed generated surface directly
  + [value] later M2B authority starts from proven dependency and ABI availability rather than guessed imports

& [DataIdentity] is explicit
  + [dependency_identity] is registry source plus package name plus exact version plus checksum
  + [feature_identity] is the sorted three-feature set with default features false
  + [ABI_identity] is structure name plus size plus alignment plus class code and policy constants
  + [probe_identity] is profile cantor-windows-topology-abi-probe/0.1
  + [evidence_identity] is source hashes plus Cargo hashes plus test hash plus verification results

& [DependencyContract] is target-scoped
  + [table] is target.'cfg(windows)'.dependencies
  + [package] is windows-sys
  + [version] is =0.61.2
  + [default_features] is false
  + [features] are Win32_Foundation, Win32_Security, and Win32_Storage_FileSystem
  + [lock_package] is already present with checksum ae137229bcbd6cdf0f7b80a31df61766145077ddf49416a728b02cb3921ff3fc
  + [lock_delta] must be empty
  + [package_count_delta] must be zero

& [FunctionAvailabilitySet] is compile-only
  + [CreateFileW] must resolve from Win32_Storage_FileSystem with Win32_Security
  + [GetFileInformationByHandleEx] must resolve from Win32_Storage_FileSystem
  + [GetFinalPathNameByHandleW] must resolve from Win32_Storage_FileSystem
  + [GetVolumeInformationByHandleW] must resolve from Win32_Storage_FileSystem
  + [GetLastError] must resolve from Win32_Foundation
  + [probe_operation] is bind each function item to an inferred local value
  - never: invoke, cast to an address, pass an argument, or retain a callable outside the test

& [StructureAvailabilitySet] is compile-time data
  + [FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TAG_INFO] is attributes and reparse tag
  + [FILE_CASE_SENSITIVE_INFO] is case flags
  + [FILE_ID_INFO] is volume serial and 128-bit file ID
  + [FILE_STANDARD_INFO] is allocation, length, link count, delete-pending, and directory facts
  + [FILE_STREAM_INFO] is variable stream-record header and one UTF-16 element
  + [FILE_REMOTE_PROTOCOL_INFO] is remote protocol evidence
  + [inspection] is size_of and align_of only
  - never: construct uninitialized values, dereference a pointer, or interpret bytes

& [ClassAvailabilitySet] is exact
  + [FileStandardInfo] is 1
  + [FileStreamInfo] is 7
  + [FileAttributeTagInfo] is 9
  + [FileRemoteProtocolInfo] is 13
  + [FileIdInfo] is 18
  + [FileCaseSensitiveInfo] is 23

& [PolicyConstantSet] is observation-only
  + [OPEN_EXISTING] is 3
  + [FILE_SHARE_READ] is 1
  + [FILE_SHARE_WRITE] is 2
  + [FILE_SHARE_DELETE] is 4
  + [share_union] is 7
  + [FILE_FLAG_BACKUP_SEMANTICS] is 33554432
  + [FILE_FLAG_OPEN_REPARSE_POINT] is 2097152
  + [FILE_ATTRIBUTE_REPARSE_POINT] is 1024
  + [FILE_ATTRIBUTE_SPARSE_FILE] is 512
  + [FILE_ATTRIBUTE_NORMAL] is 128
  + [FILE_READ_ATTRIBUTES] is 128
  + [FILE_GENERIC_READ] must not include FILE_WRITE_DATA or FILE_WRITE_ATTRIBUTES
  + [VOLUME_NAME_GUID] and [FILE_NAME_NORMALIZED] must resolve

& [ProbeFile] is isolated
  + [path] is crates/cantor_ecosystem/tests/windows_topology_abi_probe.rs
  + [crate_cfg] is windows
  + [tests] are dependency identity, generated call availability, ABI fingerprint, class codes, and policy constants
  + [machine_form] is deterministic JSON assembled in memory and compared exactly
  + [production_export] is none
  + [filesystem_input] is none
  + [environment_input] is none

& [RequirementSet] is M2B-ABI-001 through M2B-ABI-010
  + [M2B-ABI-001] preserve exact source, research, hashes, and lineage
  + [M2B-ABI-002] declare exact target-specific dependency and features
  + [M2B-ABI-003] prove Cargo.lock and package count do not change
  + [M2B-ABI-004] compile the five closed generated function items without invocation
  + [M2B-ABI-005] inspect six closed generated structures without memory interpretation
  + [M2B-ABI-006] assert six exact information-class values
  + [M2B-ABI-007] assert the closed observation-policy constants and absence of write access
  + [M2B-ABI-008] emit and compare a deterministic in-memory fingerprint
  + [M2B-ABI-009] prove zero unsafe, call expression, production API, or physical effect
  + [M2B-ABI-010] pass global gates, evidence, audit, rollback, registry, and support review

& [ConstraintLedger] is closed
  + [C-01] source and research remain immutable
  + [C-02] Windows dependency is target-specific and exact
  + [C-03] default features remain false
  + [C-04] feature list contains exactly three names
  + [C-05] Cargo.lock remains byte-identical
  + [C-06] imported function names never occur as call expressions
  + [C-07] test source contains no unsafe token or raw ownership transfer
  + [C-08] no production source or public export changes
  + [C-09] test consumes no path, handle, environment, clock, random, process, network, or model input
  + [C-10] evidence cannot claim runtime API success

& [AssumptionSet] is small
  ~ [generated_binding] locked registry source faithfully represents windows-sys 0.61.2
  ~ [Windows_link] referencing function items proves generated declarations and linker import availability on the current toolchain
  + [limit] neither assumption proves an API call would succeed for any handle or filesystem

& [NonGoalSet] is broad
  + [not_wrapper] no safe or unsafe Windows wrapper
  + [not_parser] no stream-buffer parser
  + [not_path] no path validation beyond already completed pure receipt forms
  + [not_preflight] no volume, remote, filesystem, or OS-version observation
  + [not_scanner] no directory inventory, content read, receipt issuance, or race handling
  + [not_fixture] no file or directory creation

& [RiskSet] is inspectable
  + [feature_leak] broad transitive features mistaken for Cantor's contract
  + [call_leak] presence check accidentally invokes an FFI function
  + [write_leak] policy fingerprint admits write or delete access
  + [lock_drift] dependency edit changes registry resolution
  + [platform_overclaim] current Windows compile result generalized to runtime or other targets
  + [evidence_staleness] Cargo change invalidates predecessor manifests

& [FailureModeSet] is fail-closed
  + [FM-01] missing feature fails compilation
  + [FM-02] wrong class code fails assertion
  + [FM-03] changed ABI size or alignment fails fingerprint
  + [FM-04] write constant or unexpected access mask fails assertion
  + [FM-05] any lock diff blocks publication
  + [FM-06] any call-expression or unsafe-source match blocks publication
  + [FM-07] any predecessor evidence mismatch requires ordered regeneration

& [VerificationPlan] is ordered
  + [V-01] hash pre-change Cargo and lock
  + [V-02] add exact dependency and prove lock diff empty
  + [V-03] compile and run the Windows-only focused probe
  + [V-04] statically scan the probe for unsafe and imported-name call expressions
  + [V-05] run global debug and overflow-checked release workspaces
  + [V-06] run format, lint, release build, rustdoc, and audit
  + [V-07] regenerate every evidence manifest whose artifact set binds changed Cargo or tests
  + [V-08] issue proof with explicit nonclaim and rollback

& [DataDesignModel] is stable
  + [conceptual] is generated ABI availability
  + [logical] is dependency, feature, function, structure, class, and constant records
  + [physical] is Cargo target dependency plus integration-test assertions
  + [source_truth] is locked registry metadata and generated source
  + [derived_projection] is the in-memory fingerprint
  + [invalidation] is package, checksum, feature, target, toolchain, generated source, or test change

& [SemanticRefinementTrace] is explicit
  + [dependency] narrowed from transitive presence to Cantor-owned exact contract
  + [probe] narrowed from potential API experiment to no-call compile/link inspection
  + [ABI] narrowed from broad FileSystem module to five functions, six structures, six classes, and selected constants
  + [truth] narrowed from platform support to current-toolchain generated availability

& [ConstraintCheckTrace] is passed
  + [grounding] source, local lock, generated source, prior unsafe review, and completed-work review
  + [conflict] prior readiness suggested a compile probe but did not authorize Cargo change
  + [repair] this separate source and SJS boundary grants only exact dependency and test changes
  + [result] all ten requirements are source-grounded

& [FoldTrace] is seven-fold
  + [fold_1_gain] separates dependency identity from runtime call authority
  + [fold_2_gain] freezes exact features and package checksum
  + [fold_3_gain] closes function, structure, class, and policy sets
  + [fold_4_gain] defines no-call and no-unsafe source invariants
  + [fold_5_gain] defines lock, package-count, and predecessor-evidence consequences
  + [fold_6_gain] defines deterministic fingerprint and platform nonclaim
  + [fold_7_gain] leaves physical preflight as a separate frontier

& [PruningTrace] preserves rejected expansion
  + [pruned] production module because no runtime surface is needed
  + [pruned] FFI wrapper because invocation authority is absent
  + [pruned] path or handle fixture because physical authority is absent
  + [pruned] broad windows-sys features because only three are required
  + [pruned] cross-target runtime claim because only current Windows compilation is measured

& [GrowthSeedSet] is future work
  + [M2B_preflight] pure forms for local NTFS and remote classification
  + [M2C_wrapper] separately governed no-follow handle and query implementation
  + [M2D_fixture] separately authorized physical adversarial proof
  - never: treat these seeds as present authority

& [ExhaustionReview] is phase-locked
  + [exhaustion_state] is phase_locked
  + [reason] further expansion enters runtime calls or physical proof outside the source boundary
  + [implementation_readiness] is ready for exact Cargo and test-only probe changes
